&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Mentimeter is an engagement company with a simple goal: to make every leader better. Through interaction, insights and recommendations, its platform helps organizations turn participation into better understanding and stronger performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in Stockholm in 2012, Mentimeter is used by 20 million people each month across 1.3 million organizations. At Mentimeter, we believe better leadership starts with listening and that the strongest results are achieved together. That’s why we foster a culture built on curiosity, collaboration and shared ownership. By joining us, you’ll help leaders turn participation into deeper understanding and stronger performance, advancing our ambition to help more than one billion people listen, learn and work better together.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;job__description body&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;As an Account Manager, you will own the commercial growth of a portfolio of existing Enterprise customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a commercial, quota-carrying growth role. You’ll drive expansion by identifying new opportunities, building pipeline, growing Mentimeter into new teams and use cases, and owning renewals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong customer relationships are key to succeeding, but this isn’t about simply managing an existing book of business. We’re looking for someone proactive and commercially driven - someone who gets energy from finding the next opportunity and turning customer value into growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll have a lot of ownership over how you reach your goals, while partnering closely with Customer Success Managers who focus on helping customers realize value from Mentimeter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities for the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the commercial performance of your Enterprise customer portfolio, including expansion and renewals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify and create upsell and expansion opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and manage a healthy pipeline and deliver against your commercial targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expand relationships into new stakeholders, teams and use cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build long-term customer relationships while maintaining a clear commercial agenda&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data and customer insights to prioritize opportunities and manage commercial risks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Customer Success Managers to drive customer value, retention and growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will help you succeed&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We think you’ll thrive here if you:&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have previous SaaS sales experience and experience working towards commercial targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy creating opportunities and building pipeline, not only managing existing relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have strong discovery, negotiation, pipeline management, and forecasting skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Know how to navigate customer organizations and engage multiple stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are familiar with sales methodologies such as MEDDPICC/MEDPIC, SPIN, BANT, Challenger or similar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are comfortable managing multiple customers and prioritizing where you can create the most impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate clearly and confidently in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Most importantly, we’re looking for someone who is hungry and humble: ambitious about what you want to achieve and how you want to grow, while being collaborative, curious and generous with the people around you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Mentimeter can offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mentimeter is growing, and we have ambitious goals for where we want to go next. You’ll work alongside smart, motivated people who care deeply about what they do, with meaningful ownership and plenty of opportunity to grow your career as the company grows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re ambitious, but ambition here doesn’t mean sharp elbows. We want people to challenge themselves, take ownership and keep raising the bar while remaining kind, curious and collaborative.&amp;nbsp;We also believe in sustainable performance and a healthy work-life balance. We want you to be able to do great work, keep developing and build a career here for the long term.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be working on a beloved product used by more than 500 million people, supported by Marketing, Product, Sales Development and Sales Operations teams, as well as professional CRM and data tools&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Not required:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You don’t have to know Swedish (we are an English-first organization, daily work is carried out in English and the Mentimeter team currently boasts over 50 different nationalities!)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that this position is located onsite in Stockholm, with the starting date being flexible yet ideally as soon as possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation at Mentimeter&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Mentimeter, we believe in fair and transparent compensation that grows with you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The salary range for this role is SEK 50–60,000 per month. It’s intentionally broad to reflect the different stages of growth within the role: from early development to deep expertise and meaningful impact.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Where an individual is placed within the range depends on factors such as relevant experience, demonstrated skills, and alignment with the role’s requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re committed to supporting your growth. You’ll have ongoing development conversations with your manager, and your salary will evolve as you build skills and contribute to our mission.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to your monthly salary, we offer a comprehensive benefits package—learn more about it here: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mentimeter.com/benefits/stockholm&quot;&gt;https://www.mentimeter.com/benefits/stockholm&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Mentimeter can offer&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;At Mentimeter we can offer a diverse and inclusive work environment supported by smart and driven colleagues. We believe in continuous professional development for all of our colleagues and therefore offer access to a leadership program (including external personal coach) and relevant education to ensure that we continue to be state-of-the-art when it comes to innovating and building Mentimeter. Your place will be in a growing company with lots of career opportunities, working on a beloved product used by more than 300 million people. It’s not all about work though, we also offer a very healthy view on work-life balance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All of this comes attached with a competitive compensation and benefits package, including pension contributions. Learn more about our benefits by visiting our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mentimeter.com/benefits&quot;&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Perks page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;AI and Hiring at Mentimeter&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Mentimeter, we believe AI helps us work smarter - but it never replaces the human assessment, curiosity, and personal connection that define our culture and our hiring. We use AI as a sparring partner: to bounce ideas, bring new perspectives, support structure, and make our work more efficient. But the meaning, decisions, and interactions always come from people.&amp;nbsp;AI strengthens our work, but it does not define it. At Mentimeter, we’re not building an AI-driven hiring process - we’re building a people-first culture, where technology helps us listen, learn, and grow together.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture at Mentimeter&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;At Mentimeter we believe in giving everyone a voice - regardless of who you are. So we build a platform that does just that. Our platform is not only our product but also our organization. A platform where people feel safe, where differences are embraced, a place where you can have fun. We strongly encourage applicants who are people of color, LGBTQ+, women, people with disabilities, and/or formerly incarcerated people, and a college degree is not strictly required. In order to give everyone a voice, we need to be as diverse as our users.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Learn more about our culture by visiting our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mentimeter.com/culture&quot;&gt;Culture page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;Review our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mentimeter.com/trust/legal/candidate-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt; for more information.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Mentimeter is an engagement company with a simple goal: to make every leader better. Through interaction, insights and recommendations, its platform helps organizations turn participation into better understanding and stronger performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in Stockholm in 2012, Mentimeter is used by 20 million people each month across 1.3 million organizations. At Mentimeter, we believe better leadership starts with listening and that the strongest results are achieved together. That’s why we foster a culture built on curiosity, collaboration and shared ownership. By joining us, you’ll help leaders turn participation into deeper understanding and stronger performance, advancing our ambition to help more than one billion people listen, learn and work better together.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As an Account Manager, you will lead the expansion of our existing Enterprise customers by focusing on revenue growth through renewals and up-sales while serving as a trusted adviser to our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We expect you to have an entrepreneurial tempo with the main focus on commercial initiatives to drive revenue growth among our Enterprise customers. We are looking for someone who can create long-term and strategic relationships with out customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We use the theory of Predictable Revenue, and reference Dropbox and Slack when we see the future of Mentimeter. Mentimeter is a service that is loved globally and our growth has been almost 100% organic. Sales are currently growing over 10% per month and you will be the driving force to accelerate that growth even further.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities for the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full commercial ownership of our current Higher Education customers across North America.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive revenue growth by building a strong pipeline and expanding our customers. Your success is measured on Net Revenue Retention (NRR)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage a continuous pipeline for new expansion and up-sell opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ownership of renewals of ongoing agreements in order to prevent churn&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to assess business opportunities and use data in order to support decision-making towards customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a strategy for best-in-class scalable customer expansion and customer success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate together with Customer Success Managers on strategic enterprise customers in addition to working with other sales roles on a day to day basis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the marketing and product team by serving as the voice of your customers as well as listening to the market needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities not included in the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Roll-out and adoption of our enterprise solution with our customers is mainly done by Customer Success Managers (Although for certain accounts that will be done by Relationship Managers as well)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Closing new customer contracts (Account Executives does that)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Day-to-day support (We have minimal support, and a support specialist is responsible for this)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Resources we have to support you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;World-class lead-generation from the Marketing and Product teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Marketing and Sales team to support in analysis and tactics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sales Development Representatives to support in lead qualification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sales Operation function&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional CRM and data gathering services (Intercom, Mixpanel, Google Analytics, Salesforce)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must-haves for the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of 2+ years as CSM or Account Manager in SaaS industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Sales and achieving a sales quota.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to assess business opportunities and use data to make informed decisions and persuade others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for building long-term relationships as well as driving commercial initiatives with customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of software contract terms and conditions with the ability to create fair transactions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong negotiation, pipeline and forecasting skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Permitted to work &amp;amp; live permanently in Toronto, ON.&lt;strong&gt; (This is a hybrid role, which requires you to be in office 3 days a week. &lt;/strong&gt;This can also be subject to change depending on business needs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor or masters degree (field not important)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation model:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We strongly believe in the power of togetherness, and we put a lot of effort into collaboration, teamwork and helping each other whenever needed. We believe that every part of Mentimeter, from Sales Development Representatives and Account Executives to Frontend Developers and Marketing Managers contributes equally to our continued success. To foster and emphasize this culture and way of working, &lt;strong&gt;we apply a non-commission based salary model in our sales roles,&lt;/strong&gt; which has proven to be very successful and appreciated across the team. You can read about our benefits and perks&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mentimeter.com/benefits&quot;&gt; here&lt;/a&gt;. Compensation span for this role: $97,000 - $125,000 CAD.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Mentimeter can offer&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;At Mentimeter we can offer a diverse and inclusive work environment supported by smart and driven colleagues. We believe in continuous professional development for all of our colleagues and therefore offer access to a leadership program (including external personal coach) and relevant education to ensure that we continue to be state-of-the-art when it comes to innovating and building Mentimeter. Your place will be in a growing company with lots of career opportunities, working on a beloved product used by more than 300 million people. It’s not all about work though, we also offer a very healthy view on work-life balance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All of this comes attached with a competitive compensation and benefits package, including pension contributions. Learn more about our benefits by visiting our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mentimeter.com/benefits&quot;&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Perks page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;AI and Hiring at Mentimeter&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Mentimeter, we believe AI helps us work smarter - but it never replaces the human assessment, curiosity, and personal connection that define our culture and our hiring. We use AI as a sparring partner: to bounce ideas, bring new perspectives, support structure, and make our work more efficient. But the meaning, decisions, and interactions always come from people.&amp;nbsp;AI strengthens our work, but it does not define it. At Mentimeter, we’re not building an AI-driven hiring process - we’re building a people-first culture, where technology helps us listen, learn, and grow together.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture at Mentimeter&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;At Mentimeter we believe in giving everyone a voice - regardless of who you are. So we build a platform that does just that. Our platform is not only our product but also our organization. A platform where people feel safe, where differences are embraced, a place where you can have fun. We strongly encourage applicants who are people of color, LGBTQ+, women, people with disabilities, and/or formerly incarcerated people, and a college degree is not strictly required. In order to give everyone a voice, we need to be as diverse as our users.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Learn more about our culture by visiting our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mentimeter.com/culture&quot;&gt;Culture page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;Review our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mentimeter.com/trust/legal/candidate-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt; for more information.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Mentimeter is an engagement company with a simple goal: to make every leader better. Through interaction, insights and recommendations, its platform helps organizations turn participation into better understanding and stronger performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in Stockholm in 2012, Mentimeter is used by 20 million people each month across 1.3 million organizations. At Mentimeter, we believe better leadership starts with listening and that the strongest results are achieved together. That’s why we foster a culture built on curiosity, collaboration and shared ownership. By joining us, you’ll help leaders turn participation into deeper understanding and stronger performance, advancing our ambition to help more than one billion people listen, learn and work better together.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Brand Director, you&#39;ll lead Mentimeter&#39;s brand team and the creative work that helps people understand, recognize and choose us. You&#39;ll set an ambitious creative direction, develop the team, and build the systems that help great work reach further.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to make every leader better. We have a clear brand direction grounded in that mission, and your role is to develop how we express it across audiences, channels and markets. You&#39;ll own our Brand Platform and Creative Platform, building on the strategy in place to create ideas and storytelling that people connect with and remember.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Brand sits within Design at Mentimeter. We see our product and brand as one experience, and you’ll work closely with product managers, designers, researchers, analytics and the design system team to bring that to life. Our brand designers, copywriters and producers work as an internal agency, supporting teams across the business through a retainer model that serves both of our go-to-market motions: product-led growth (PLG) and Enterprise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll lead that agency end to end: setting priorities, directing the work and developing how it gets made. That includes building AI-enabled tools and ways of working that help colleagues across Mentimeter produce on-brand material themselves, freeing the creative team to focus where their expertise makes the biggest difference.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll report to our Chief Design Officer, join the Design Leadership Team, and work closely with our CDO and CEO on the direction of the brand.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re a creative leader with depth in your craft and the ability to make the people around you better. You can turn a strategic direction into a strong creative idea, explain why it works, and help a team develop it into work that delivers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re particularly interested in a copywriting background. You enjoy working with language, ideas and storytelling, and can move comfortably between shaping a campaign concept, working through the details of a headline and coaching someone else through their approach. You&#39;ll join a team with expertise across brand design, copywriting and production, bringing your own craft and creative direction to help develop both the work and the people behind it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You also think about what makes good work possible beyond your own involvement. You&#39;ve built tools, standards or processes that others can use, and you&#39;re actively exploring how AI can improve creative production. We&#39;d like to hear what you&#39;ve tried to build, where it worked, where it fell short and how your thinking changed as a result.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience across both agency and in-house or product environments would be especially valuable. You understand how to serve different stakeholders, prioritise competing needs and keep developing a brand over time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set the creative direction:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead ideas and storytelling across Mentimeter&#39;s brand work, and run crits and reviews that help the team produce stronger work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own our brand and creative platforms:&lt;/strong&gt; Build on our strategic foundation and develop a lasting creative concept that works across audiences, channels and markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead the internal agency: &lt;/strong&gt;Own delivery, prioritisation and capacity across the business, making sure our biggest company and growth priorities get the attention they need.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build brand as a system:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop guidelines, templates, prompt libraries and AI-enabled tools that help teams produce on-brand work. Set clear standards for quality, tone of voice, IP and legal considerations, with human review where it matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Connect brand and product:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with product design and our design system team so that what people see and hear from Mentimeter feels connected to their experience of using it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead and develop our creative people: &lt;/strong&gt;Manage our brand creative and design leads, and own craft standards, hiring quality and development across design, copy and production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years in creative or brand work, including experience leading and developing creative teams across disciplines, with responsibility for both people and the quality of their work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong foundation in creative direction and storytelling, ideally rooted in copywriting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A portfolio that demonstrates your creative judgement and makes your own role and contribution clear.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience translating brand strategy into creative ideas that work across channels and markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building guidelines, templates, tools or processes that enable others to produce good work within a brand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience experimenting with AI in creative production, and thoughtful examples of what you&#39;ve learned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good business judgement and the ability to prioritise creative capacity across competing needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to build strong working relationships across creative, product and commercial teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and spoken English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience running an internal agency or retainer model is a strong advantage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Not required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You don&#39;t have to know Swedish. Daily work is carried out in English and the Mentimeter team currently boasts over 50 nationalities!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Mentimeter, we believe in fair and transparent compensation that grows with you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The salary range for this role is SEK 84,000 - SEK 98,000 per month. It&#39;s intentionally broad to reflect the different stages of growth within the role. Where an individual is placed within the range depends on factors such as relevant experience, demonstrated skills, and alignment with the role&#39;s requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re committed to supporting your growth. You&#39;ll have ongoing development conversations with your manager and build skills, contribute to our mission and have meaningful impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to your monthly salary, we offer a comprehensive benefits package - learn more about it here: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mentimeter.com/benefits/stockholm&quot;&gt;https://www.mentimeter.com/benefits/stockholm&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Mentimeter can offer&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;At Mentimeter we can offer a diverse and inclusive work environment supported by smart and driven colleagues. We believe in continuous professional development for all of our colleagues and therefore offer access to a leadership program (including external personal coach) and relevant education to ensure that we continue to be state-of-the-art when it comes to innovating and building Mentimeter. Your place will be in a growing company with lots of career opportunities, working on a beloved product used by more than 300 million people. It’s not all about work though, we also offer a very healthy view on work-life balance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All of this comes attached with a competitive compensation and benefits package, including pension contributions. Learn more about our benefits by visiting our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mentimeter.com/benefits&quot;&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Perks page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;AI and Hiring at Mentimeter&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Mentimeter, we believe AI helps us work smarter - but it never replaces the human assessment, curiosity, and personal connection that define our culture and our hiring. We use AI as a sparring partner: to bounce ideas, bring new perspectives, support structure, and make our work more efficient. But the meaning, decisions, and interactions always come from people.&amp;nbsp;AI strengthens our work, but it does not define it. At Mentimeter, we’re not building an AI-driven hiring process - we’re building a people-first culture, where technology helps us listen, learn, and grow together.&lt;/div&gt;
